        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b7",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0007"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[7]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "筋1："
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b8",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0008"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[8]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "有人立直的时候，最应该警戒的就要是"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b9",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0009"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[9]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b10",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0010"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[10]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "只要对手不是麻将的初学者，"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b11",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0011"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[11]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "一般情况下都会等待嵌张、双碰听牌变化成两面听牌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b12",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0012"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[12]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "因为对手会等待嵌张和双碰听牌变化成两面的好形听牌，"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b13",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0013"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[13]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "所以听牌了也有可能不会立直。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b14",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0014"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[14]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "因此立直的听牌形往往是两面居多，"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b15",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0015"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[15]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "大体的数据显示，所有的立直中"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b16",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0016"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[16]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b17",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0017"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[17]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "为了不铳两面听牌的理论就叫做“筋”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b18",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0018"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[18]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b19",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0019"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[19]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "6个基本筋"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b20",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0020"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[20]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b21",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1765377:b0021"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[21]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "我们来看看实际的两面听牌吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1765377-b22",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1765377",
